('media_center',0,44,141,'en',0,'<p>&lt;p&gt;The training course enables its trainees to get hands-on experience in an academic library. It gives them the opportunity to spend time improving their literacy, especially in English. The library is located on the ground floor of Academic Building B of the institute.&lt;/p&gt;</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,44,142,'en',0,'<p>&lt;p&gt;The training course enables its trainees to get hands-on experience in an academic library. It gives them the opportunity to spend time improving their literacy, especially in English. The library is located on the ground floor of Academic Building B of the institute.&lt;/p&gt;</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,44,145,'en',0,'<p>&lt;p&gt;The training course enables its trainees to get hands-on experience in an academic library. It gives them the opportunity to spend time improving their literacy, especially in English. The library is located on the ground floor of Academic Building B of the institute.&lt;/p&gt;</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,44,159,'en',0,'<p>The training course enables its trainees to get hands-on experience in an academic library. It gives them the opportunity to spend time improving their literacy, especially in English. The library is located on the ground floor of Academic Building B of the institute.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,44,165,'ar',0,'<p>تتيح الدورة التدريبية للمتدربين اكتساب خبرة عملية في مكتبة أكاديمية، وتمنحهم فرصة لقضاء الوقت في تحسين مهاراتهم في القراءة والكتابة، ولا سيما باللغة الإنجليزية. وتقع المكتبة في الطابق الأرضي من المبنى الأكاديمي (ب).</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,44,165,'en',0,'<p>The training course enables its trainees to get hands-on experience in an academic library. It gives them the opportunity to spend time improving their literacy, especially in English. The library is located on the ground floor of Academic Building B of the institute.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,44,176,'ar',0,'<p>تتيح الدورة التدريبية للمتدربين اكتساب خبرة عملية في مكتبة أكاديمية، وتمنحهم فرصة لقضاء الوقت في تحسين مهاراتهم في القراءة والكتابة، ولا سيما باللغة الإنجليزية. وتقع المكتبة في الطابق الأرضي من المبنى الأكاديمي (ب).</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,44,176,'en',0,'<p>The training course enables its trainees to get hands-on experience in an academic library. It gives them the opportunity to spend time improving their literacy, especially in English. The library is located on the ground floor of Academic Building B of the institute.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,45,143,'en',0,'<p>&lt;p&gt;There are four EWA computer labs across campus. They serve as physical learning and study destinations, providing trainees with the latest and greatest computing tools, software, printing, and other technology resources to accomplish their academic goals for instruction, research, and presentation. These labs are also used for regularly scheduled computer classes, summer online courses, online exams, and certification programs related to VSE, Takamol, and CWQAT Saudi Aramco that need online testing.&lt;/p&gt;</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,45,144,'en',0,'<p>&lt;p&gt;There are four EWA computer labs across campus. They serve as physical learning and study destinations, providing trainees with the latest and greatest computing tools, software, printing, and other technology resources to accomplish their academic goals for instruction, research, and presentation. These labs are also used for regularly scheduled computer classes, summer online courses, online exams, and certification programs related to VSE, Takamol, and CWQAT Saudi Aramco that need online testing.&lt;/p&gt;</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,45,160,'en',0,'<p>There are four EWA computer labs across campus. They serve as physical learning and study destinations, providing trainees with the latest and greatest computing tools, software, printing, and other technology resources to accomplish their academic goals for instruction, research, and presentation. These labs are also used for regularly scheduled computer classes, summer online courses, online exams, and certification programs related to VSE, Takamol, and CWQAT Saudi Aramco that need online testing.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,45,166,'ar',0,'<p>تضم الأكاديمية أربعة معامل للحاسب الآلي موزّعة في أرجاء الحرم، وهي وجهات للتعلّم والدراسة توفّر للمتدربين أحدث أدوات الحوسبة والبرمجيات وخدمات الطباعة وغيرها من الموارد التقنية لتحقيق أهدافهم الأكاديمية في التعليم والبحث والعروض التقديمية. وتُستخدم هذه المعامل أيضًا لحصص الحاسب المجدولة والدورات الصيفية عن بُعد والاختبارات الإلكترونية وبرامج الشهادات المرتبطة بـ VSE وتكامل و CWQAT أرامكو السعودية التي تتطلب اختبارات إلكترونية.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,45,166,'en',0,'<p>There are four EWA computer labs across campus. They serve as physical learning and study destinations, providing trainees with the latest and greatest computing tools, software, printing, and other technology resources to accomplish their academic goals for instruction, research, and presentation. These labs are also used for regularly scheduled computer classes, summer online courses, online exams, and certification programs related to VSE, Takamol, and CWQAT Saudi Aramco that need online testing.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,45,177,'ar',0,'<p>تضم الأكاديمية أربعة معامل للحاسب الآلي موزّعة في أرجاء الحرم، وهي وجهات للتعلّم والدراسة توفّر للمتدربين أحدث أدوات الحوسبة والبرمجيات وخدمات الطباعة وغيرها من الموارد التقنية لتحقيق أهدافهم الأكاديمية في التعليم والبحث والعروض التقديمية. وتُستخدم هذه المعامل أيضًا لحصص الحاسب المجدولة والدورات الصيفية عن بُعد والاختبارات الإلكترونية وبرامج الشهادات المرتبطة بـ VSE وتكامل و CWQAT أرامكو السعودية التي تتطلب اختبارات إلكترونية.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,45,177,'en',0,'<p>There are four EWA computer labs across campus. They serve as physical learning and study destinations, providing trainees with the latest and greatest computing tools, software, printing, and other technology resources to accomplish their academic goals for instruction, research, and presentation. These labs are also used for regularly scheduled computer classes, summer online courses, online exams, and certification programs related to VSE, Takamol, and CWQAT Saudi Aramco that need online testing.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,46,148,'en',0,'<p>&lt;p&gt;Simulator training is one of the institute\'s specialized programs. It has two areas:&lt;/p&gt;</p><p>&lt;ol&gt;<br>&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;For local and CCR operators, the Workshop\'s Process Area houses simulations for combined cycle gas turbines, thermal power, and reverse osmosis.<br>&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;<br>&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;A virtual reality welding training simulator is used to augment the training of trainees in the welding course and it\'s located in the Mechanical Workshop.<br>&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ol&gt;</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,46,156,'en',0,'<p>Simulator training is one of the institute\'s specialized programs. It has two areas:</p><ol><li data-list-item-id=\"ef414b808b33e0bc998b66be9921a1b70\">For local and CCR operators, the Workshop\'s Process Area houses simulations for combined cycle gas turbines, thermal power, and reverse osmosis.</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ef39784a1bf05767f4eac76919e69b46e\">A virtual reality welding training simulator is used to augment the training of trainees in the welding course and it\'s located in the Mechanical Workshop.</li></ol>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,46,167,'ar',0,'<p>يُعد التدريب بالمحاكاة أحد البرامج المتخصصة في الأكاديمية، ويشمل منطقتين:</p><ol><li data-list-item-id=\"ec576b54412824503bb93588e5c7ecb6f\">لمشغّلي المحطات المحليين ومشغّلي غرف التحكم المركزية، تضم منطقة العمليات في الورشة أجهزة محاكاة لتوربينات الغاز ذات الدورة المركبة والطاقة الحرارية والتناضح العكسي.</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e18510217d5fa1f1e497ab795eeaf3195\">جهاز محاكاة للتدريب على اللحام بتقنية الواقع الافتراضي يُستخدم لتعزيز تدريب المتدربين في دورة اللحام، ويقع في الورشة الميكانيكية.</li></ol>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,46,167,'en',0,'<p>Simulator training is one of the institute\'s specialized programs. It has two areas:</p><ol><li data-list-item-id=\"ef414b808b33e0bc998b66be9921a1b70\">For local and CCR operators, the Workshop\'s Process Area houses simulations for combined cycle gas turbines, thermal power, and reverse osmosis.</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ef39784a1bf05767f4eac76919e69b46e\">A virtual reality welding training simulator is used to augment the training of trainees in the welding course and it\'s located in the Mechanical Workshop.</li></ol>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,46,178,'ar',0,'<p>يُعد التدريب بالمحاكاة أحد البرامج المتخصصة في الأكاديمية، ويشمل منطقتين:</p><ol><li data-list-item-id=\"ec576b54412824503bb93588e5c7ecb6f\">لمشغّلي المحطات المحليين ومشغّلي غرف التحكم المركزية، تضم منطقة العمليات في الورشة أجهزة محاكاة لتوربينات الغاز ذات الدورة المركبة والطاقة الحرارية والتناضح العكسي.</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e18510217d5fa1f1e497ab795eeaf3195\">جهاز محاكاة للتدريب على اللحام بتقنية الواقع الافتراضي يُستخدم لتعزيز تدريب المتدربين في دورة اللحام، ويقع في الورشة الميكانيكية.</li></ol>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,46,178,'en',0,'<p>Simulator training is one of the institute\'s specialized programs. It has two areas:</p><ol><li data-list-item-id=\"ef414b808b33e0bc998b66be9921a1b70\">For local and CCR operators, the Workshop\'s Process Area houses simulations for combined cycle gas turbines, thermal power, and reverse osmosis.</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ef39784a1bf05767f4eac76919e69b46e\">A virtual reality welding training simulator is used to augment the training of trainees in the welding course and it\'s located in the Mechanical Workshop.</li></ol>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,47,149,'en',0,'<p>&lt;p&gt;<br>&nbsp;A core part of EWA\'s training journey, where theoretical knowledge is applied practically. Divided into six specialty areas:<br>&lt;/p&gt;<br>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Electricity<br>&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;<br>&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Operations<br>&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;<br>&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Desalination<br>&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;<br>&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Innovation &amp;amp; Creativity Center<br>&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;<br>&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Renewable Energy<br>&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;<br>&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Welding<br>&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;<br>&lt;p&gt;<br>&nbsp;These are interactive, tech-equipped spaces, including virtual reality tools for hands-on, advanced learning.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,47,155,'en',0,'<p>A core part of EWA\'s training journey, where theoretical knowledge is applied practically. Divided into six specialty areas:</p><ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e909cb21bfa4971d24a7925fb3a8f8991\">Electricity</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e375c098f379c6be6b608adab4a653f4b\">Operations</li><li data-list-item-id=\"edd61c66e9e3c915b7271900538fa7271\">Desalination</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ecd939bc46cb19db9740d0a8690f8c090\">Innovation &amp; Creativity Center</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ea1275af2879e8d4e417ec7d0b0e88e11\">Renewable Energy</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e6ebdfdd5c4386d22275f36db084abe8c\">Welding</li></ul><p>These are interactive, tech-equipped spaces, including virtual reality tools for hands-on, advanced learning.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,47,168,'ar',0,'<p>جزء أساسي من رحلة التدريب في الأكاديمية، حيث تُطبَّق المعرفة النظرية عمليًا. وتنقسم إلى ست مناطق تخصصية:</p><ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e0b43154d739d2211262741e496f5f5ae\">الكهرباء</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e007fb44789e55158bebc5c4f0fc86e69\">التشغيل</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e454fc00cc5b26f4b374d0e81f5de3a85\">التحلية</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e172a3b7cc7db29907c9ca89ec8e8f5b8\">مركز الابتكار والإبداع</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e3de9c7514faaa4e3256c76f01cb0d6ce\">الطاقة المتجددة</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ed5125bc3dab9a4e8b1f48070c6847b35\">اللحام</li></ul><p>وهي مساحات تفاعلية مجهّزة تقنيًا، تشمل أدوات الواقع الافتراضي للتعلّم العملي المتقدم.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,47,168,'en',0,'<p>A core part of EWA\'s training journey, where theoretical knowledge is applied practically. Divided into six specialty areas:</p><ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e909cb21bfa4971d24a7925fb3a8f8991\">Electricity</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e375c098f379c6be6b608adab4a653f4b\">Operations</li><li data-list-item-id=\"edd61c66e9e3c915b7271900538fa7271\">Desalination</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ecd939bc46cb19db9740d0a8690f8c090\">Innovation &amp; Creativity Center</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ea1275af2879e8d4e417ec7d0b0e88e11\">Renewable Energy</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e6ebdfdd5c4386d22275f36db084abe8c\">Welding</li></ul><p>These are interactive, tech-equipped spaces, including virtual reality tools for hands-on, advanced learning.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,47,179,'ar',0,'<p>جزء أساسي من رحلة التدريب في الأكاديمية، حيث تُطبَّق المعرفة النظرية عمليًا. وتنقسم إلى ست مناطق تخصصية:</p><ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e0b43154d739d2211262741e496f5f5ae\">الكهرباء</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e007fb44789e55158bebc5c4f0fc86e69\">التشغيل</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e454fc00cc5b26f4b374d0e81f5de3a85\">التحلية</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e172a3b7cc7db29907c9ca89ec8e8f5b8\">مركز الابتكار والإبداع</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e3de9c7514faaa4e3256c76f01cb0d6ce\">الطاقة المتجددة</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ed5125bc3dab9a4e8b1f48070c6847b35\">اللحام</li></ul><p>وهي مساحات تفاعلية مجهّزة تقنيًا، تشمل أدوات الواقع الافتراضي للتعلّم العملي المتقدم.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,47,179,'en',0,'<p>A core part of EWA\'s training journey, where theoretical knowledge is applied practically. Divided into six specialty areas:</p><ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e909cb21bfa4971d24a7925fb3a8f8991\">Electricity</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e375c098f379c6be6b608adab4a653f4b\">Operations</li><li data-list-item-id=\"edd61c66e9e3c915b7271900538fa7271\">Desalination</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ecd939bc46cb19db9740d0a8690f8c090\">Innovation &amp; Creativity Center</li><li data-list-item-id=\"ea1275af2879e8d4e417ec7d0b0e88e11\">Renewable Energy</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e6ebdfdd5c4386d22275f36db084abe8c\">Welding</li></ul><p>These are interactive, tech-equipped spaces, including virtual reality tools for hands-on, advanced learning.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,48,150,'en',0,'<p>&lt;p&gt;Fully-equipped accommodation for male and female trainees with all comfort and safety measures. Includes furnished rooms with private bathrooms, lounges, kitchens, internet, laundry rooms, and safety systems (monitoring and alarms).&lt;/p&gt;</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,48,154,'en',0,'<p>Fully-equipped accommodation for male and female trainees with all comfort and safety measures. Includes furnished rooms with private bathrooms, lounges, kitchens, internet, laundry rooms, and safety systems (monitoring and alarms).</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,48,169,'ar',0,'<p>سكن مجهّز بالكامل للمتدربين والمتدربات يوفّر جميع وسائل الراحة والسلامة، ويشمل غرفًا مفروشة بدورات مياه خاصة وصالات ومطابخ وخدمة إنترنت وغرف غسيل وأنظمة سلامة (مراقبة وإنذار).</p>','full_html'),
