('media_center',0,49,151,'en',0,'<p>&lt;ul&gt;<br>&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;A football field next to the gym<br>&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;<br>&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Volleyball court<br>&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;<br>&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Basketball court<br>&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;<br>&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Swimming pool<br>&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;<br>&nbsp;&lt;li&gt;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;Fitness club for trainees<br>&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;<br>&lt;/ul&gt;<br>&lt;p&gt;<br>&nbsp;Trainees can unwind after training sessions and participate in regular sports tournaments across various games like football and volleyball as part of the Academy\'s extracurricular engagement.<br>&lt;/p&gt;</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,49,153,'en',0,'<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e5c91b530f457808962da646e9ba0af94\">A football field next to the gym</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e5b178286844bffa6018221a26c0bb115\">Volleyball court</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e645bada42db6023a853f4b88b2b7c7d6\">Basketball court</li><li data-list-item-id=\"eee934897c54dbad453a715f8b2bd4b50\">Swimming pool</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e73caebd8a40d2bb0fdfa40ec9f65c5e7\">Fitness club for trainees</li></ul><p>Trainees can unwind after training sessions and participate in regular sports tournaments across various games like football and volleyball as part of the Academy\'s extracurricular engagement.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,49,170,'ar',0,'<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"ebc310f52f692da52d329b84338f8c6fe\">ملعب كرة قدم بجوار الصالة الرياضية</li><li data-list-item-id=\"edca31cd697b4fa5d21303d24d4aee17b\">ملعب كرة طائرة</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e94024e0c267f67db740cb19eef46c64d\">ملعب كرة سلة</li><li data-list-item-id=\"edd89a84901366d71ab5c23b24f59b28b\">مسبح</li><li data-list-item-id=\"e6da3d27c3a27100e1baeaa7bc099fdda\">نادٍ رياضي للمتدربين</li></ul><p>يمكن للمتدربين الاسترخاء بعد الجلسات التدريبية والمشاركة في بطولات رياضية منتظمة في ألعاب متنوعة مثل كرة القدم والكرة الطائرة، ضمن الأنشطة اللاصفية في الأكاديمية.</p>','full_html'),
