('media_center',0,50,152,'en',0,'<p>The institute provides accommodation for its trainees as well as for staff and guests. The housing is split into Building A and Building B.</p><p>Each building offers fully furnished rooms with attached bathrooms, as well as kitchens and household equipment that are available. The building has internet access, laundry rooms, security cameras, and fire safety features.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,50,171,'ar',0,'<p>توفّر الأكاديمية السكن لمتدربيها وكذلك للموظفين والضيوف، وينقسم السكن إلى المبنى (أ) والمبنى (ب).</p><p>يوفّر كل مبنى غرفًا مفروشة بالكامل بدورات مياه ملحقة، إضافة إلى مطابخ وأدوات منزلية متاحة. ويتوفر في المبنى إنترنت وغرف غسيل وكاميرات مراقبة وأنظمة للسلامة من الحريق.</p>','full_html'),
('media_center',0,50,171,'en',0,'<p>The institute provides accommodation for its trainees as well as for staff and guests. The housing is split into Building A and Building B.</p><p>Each building offers fully furnished rooms with attached bathrooms, as well as kitchens and household equipment that are available. The building has internet access, laundry rooms, security cameras, and fire safety features.</p>','full_html'),
